From: Maicon Alves <maicon.alves@posthaus.com.br>
Subject: [PATCH] gallium/hud: goodluckOS feedback panel and status bar

Draws over any app, even with the graphs hidden:
- the volume / brightness / audio output feedback that osd-notify.sh writes
  to /dev/shm/hud-osd, for 1.5 s;
- with GALLIUM_HUD_STATUS set, a status bar with the battery (from sysfs) and
  the volume and output that hud-status.sh writes to /dev/shm/hud-status.
Both use the launcher's colors and icons. Text can now have a color and a
scale (GALLIUM_HUD_TEXT_SCALE, 1.5 by default).

---
